{"id":"a93b83e8c9de9da6","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-independent-set-np-complete.md","title":"INDEPENDENT-SET is NP-Complete","display":"thm-independent-set-np-complete — INDEPENDENT-SET is NP-Complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-independent-set-np-complete","aliases":["28-thm-independent-set-np-complete","INDEPENDENT-SET is NP-Complete"],"display":"thm-independent-set-np-complete — INDEPENDENT-SET is NP-Complete","depends_on":["[[28-df-independent-set]]","[[28-df-clique]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-thm-clique-np-complete]]"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-independent-set-np-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-independent-set-np-complete</span><span>INDEPENDENT-SET is NP-Complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-independent-set-np-complete — INDEPENDENT-SET is NP-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9b48ca7c5c96f8c5\" href=\"?note=9b48ca7c5c96f8c5\" title=\"28-df-independent-set\">28-df-independent-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e536fad96aebabd\" href=\"?note=1e536fad96aebabd\" title=\"28-df-clique\">28-df-clique</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"809f5c1aa673552a\" href=\"?note=809f5c1aa673552a\" title=\"28-thm-clique-np-complete\">28-thm-clique-np-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IS}\">\\(\\mathrm{IS}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见本目录对应定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline G=(V,\\{e\\subseteq V\\mid|e|=2\\}\\setminus E)\">\\(\\overline G=(V,\\{e\\subseteq V\\mid|e|=2\\}\\setminus E)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IS}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{IS}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IS}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{IS}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\in\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(\\overline G,k)\\in\\mathrm{IS}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\in\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(\\overline G,k)\\in\\mathrm{IS}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取补图把团变为同一顶点集上的独立集，并保持阈值；标准邻接矩阵取补可在多项式时间完成。无效编码映到固定独立集否例。原书定理2.15另从 3SAT 构造每子句的满足部分赋值簇，用不一致边和簇内边限制独立集；两种路线结论相同。顶点集是多项式证据。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.15及证明；印刷51–52页；PDF77–78页。原书陈述和部分赋值簇证明已读；补图路线为本地简化推导。</p>\n<p>R6依赖证据复核：完整NP难性依赖3SAT/CLIQUE的受限证明。本地推导记录保留；完整结论当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-independent-set","status":"resolved","id":"9b48ca7c5c96f8c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-independent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-clique","status":"resolved","id":"1e536fad96aebabd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-clique]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-clique-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"809f5c1aa673552a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-clique-np-complete]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline G=(V,\\{e\\subseteq V\\mid|e|=2\\}\\setminus E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IS}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{IS}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\in\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}(\\overline G,k)\\in\\mathrm{IS}.","display":true}],"bytes":1724,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"NP 完全性：[[28-thm-clique-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-independent-set-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-3coloring-np-complete]]。"},{"id":"b5b8f3d84579602d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9b48ca7c5c96f8c5","1e536fad96aebabd","7a9125ebbfdef91e","14088421136f8182","809f5c1aa673552a"]}